{"ID":"20240205153728-yc748z9","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153728-yc748z9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153728-yc748z9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095204-eu42eht\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095723-97v3ym2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:800,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619190001-ih7864d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"稻芽","type":"doc","updated":"20240902143544"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206095204-eu42eht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095204-eu42eht","updated":"20240206095212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t各产稻区均产。\n【性状】\t稻芽呈扁长椭圆形，两端略尖，长79mm，直径约3mm。外稃黄色，有白色细茸毛，具5脉。一端有2枚对称的白色条形浆片，长23mm，于一个条形浆片内侧伸出弯曲的须根13条，长0.51.2cm。质硬，断面白色，粉性。无臭，味淡。\n【性味】\t甘，温。\n【功效】\t消食和中，健脾开胃。用于食积不消，腹胀口臭，脾胃虚弱，不饥食少。炒稻芽偏于消食。用于不饥食少。焦稻芽善化积滞。用于积滞不消。"}]},{"ID":"20240206095205-u9ofjtw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095205-u9ofjtw","updated":"20240718175434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 757px;","style":"width: 747px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206095205-608wgbi.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 747px;\" parent-style=\"width: 757px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718175442-kf8bau0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718175442-kf8bau0","updated":"20240718175442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 501px;","style":"width: 491px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTe